<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Teledata said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Teledata said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Teledata Communications Ltd was raised to a buy from an outperform at Oppenheimer &amp; Co, according to a trading source.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/4 in early trading Tuesday to 18-5/8.</p>
</text>
